stuffing out of competitors like Chucky.

00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:32.956
"You should probably run."

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.400
All the same, "M3GAN" has a surprising amount&nbsp;
of heart for a movie with such a campy tone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.740
and goofy premise. While the android definitely&nbsp;
seems to be looking out for number one by the end&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:49.080
