about Cady and have her best interests at heart.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:54.360
This friendlier side of her is shown when she&nbsp;
serenades the troubled Cady to sleep with an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:59.820
