absolutely buzzing on social media. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:05.100
fans might recall that Anna Kendrick sang the very&nbsp;
same song in the musical comedy "Pitch Perfect,"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:11.040
and in the same acapella style that M3GAN does.&nbsp;
However, Jenna Davis, who voices the android,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:17.400
performs a double-sided take on "Titanium" by&nbsp;
David Guetta and Sia. No matter how nicely it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:22.020
sung, this lullaby is a little less than&nbsp;
comforting, and more of a major threat.

