With "M3GAN" singing and dancing&nbsp;
her way into everyone's good graces,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.720
it probably won't be long before the android&nbsp;
returns to terrorize another family in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.640
