However, now we know that M3GAN singing&nbsp;
"Titanium" was also from the mind of Johnstone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:38.160
He did an interview with Variety where he spoke&nbsp;
about all things related to "M3GAN." He revealed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.420
